    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/34b83cec1f2ebdc9cb570890712a93e354509aec.png",
    "oneLiner": "Streak transforms Gmail into a powerful CRM",
    "longDescription": "Streak is the only CRM integrated entirely within your Gmail inbox, and works alongside all your other G Suite applications. It can be used to track any business process including sales, partnerships, support, hiring, deal flow, and much more. Streak also includes a powerful set of email tools including email tracking, send later, snoozing, mail merge, and more.",
