    "oneLiner": "Push things to your other things.",
    "longDescription": "Pushbullet connects your devices, making it easy and automatic to share almost anything between them.  Our mission is to bridge the gap between your phone, tablet, and computer, enabling them to work better together.  Why is this important? Simple: in the past few years, smartphones and tablets have taken over people's digital lives. Sharing data between them and with computers, however, can be a real pain. We make it easy and automatic.",
