    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/15d37a451e4069a0883fa02ca7839c2bdcf32a99.png",
    "oneLiner": "Analytics stack for omnichannel retailers and brands",
    "longDescription": "42 is an end-to-end analytics stack for DTC and wholesale brands.  Our platform shows you the right insights and data, anytime you need them: - Hundreds of built-in metrics across Stores, eComm, Wholesale, or any other channel - See all your sales, stock and customer in one report, with images - Accurate cost, markdown and promo reporting - Get answers in real-time, during your buyer / supplier meetings - Get your store managers to use data, we've seen 10% margin increases from this - Actually know how much stock you have.  We're more than just a dashboard... - No infrastructure needed. We do the hosting and maintenance. - No integrations (for you). We do the heavy-lifting and get your data into 42 - For brands, we work with all the major retailers (via xlsx, portals or EDI) - For retailers, we can be your vendor portal - We integrate with any system - We work with you to tailor the analytics according to your products and naming  Our customers include AllSaints, Frasers Group, Incipio",
