    "oneLiner": "Drone swarm defence at a small-unit level",
    "longDescription": "Earendil Robotics builds cUAS solutions for the modern warfighter, enabling effective air defence at the small-unit level. We deliver spotting, engaging, and destroying capabilities through advanced sensors, autonomous interceptors, and integrated systems.  Our product lineup covers every stage of the kill chain, complemented by the Drone Warfare Academy that trains soldiers to eliminate enemy drone threats in contested environments.  Backed by worldwide frontline combat experience, we equip units with combat-proven tools to counter evolving aerial threats.",
