    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/ce1dcec626f9c7fdc1ea66f4d7850c7a32015773.png",
    "oneLiner": "Full Stack Pharmaceutical Company for Personalized Peptides and GLP-1s",
    "longDescription": "RonanRX is a full-stack pharmaceutical company, starting with personalized peptides and GLP-1s.  In our first 10 weeks, we went from having no pharmacy to being licensed in 33 states. Since launch, we’ve grown 50% week over week.  We manufacture the medications ourselves, sell directly to patients, and eliminate the layers of middlemen that make prescription drugs more expensive.  What makes this possible is AI.  Traditional pharmaceutical companies are built to manufacture one drug for millions of people. RonanRX is purpose-built to personalize treatment for each patient: different biology, different response, different dose.  Patients come directly to RonanRX or through doctors using our platform. Every patient completes our medical intake, meets with a licensed doctor through our telehealth platform, and receives a personalized prescription when appropriate. From there, we manufacture the medication ourselves and deliver it directly to the patient.  Labs, wearables, medical history,",
