    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/235b4dc8ef4a94e38d79ce892c9d55184a2b0224.png",
    "oneLiner": "Modernizing Chip Manufacturing Infrastructure",
    "longDescription": "We are building the future of chip manufacturing.  Chips are more advanced than ever, and the features inside them keep getting smaller. But the cleanroom infrastructure supporting their manufacture has not scaled at the same pace. Intel, TSMC, Samsung, and others spend billions building and operating massive cleanrooms, only to isolate their most advanced wafers from the surrounding facility as much as possible.  We think that architecture is backwards. Instead of making the entire building cleaner, why not make the machinery itself as clean as possible?  Talos is our proprietary tool-integrated purification system. It sits directly inside semiconductor equipment and continuously destroys airborne molecular contaminants before they reach the wafer. Instead of fighting contamination by constantly flooding tools with ultra-high-purity nitrogen, Talos keeps the environment inside the machine 10–100x cleaner, without the massive purge-gas bill.  Talos is powerful on its own, but it is als",
