    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/609d8457269ad1be9496a28a67f4cd8fd8c26af1.png",
    "oneLiner": "agents for the rest of us",
    "longDescription": "We want to bring AI agents to a billion people.  To do this, we believe it needs to be 1. proactive and 2. personal. A billion people already carry the right device, but none of them have the right connector.  Moonshot is personal intelligence that lives on your iPhone and listens to you 24/7. It continuously builds up a greater understanding of you through constantly listening and building context. It just pays deep attention, the way a good friend does. Through this, Moonshot monitors your conscious and subconscious life, figuring out what you need before you know, reminding you about open loops, identifying life and emotional trends before you recognize it, and covering a lot more of what we gloss over in daily life.  For fifty years, software has waited to be asked. We think tools are just good enough to flip this, and the next great software will provide value before asking for something first. We're doing it through Moonshot.  Our thesis is simple: you're only living half your li",
