    "oneLiner": "AI agent platform for home services companies.",
    "longDescription": "Home services companies lose money on missed calls and idle techs. When the phone rings during a job and nobody picks up, that lead goes to a competitor and the trucks already on the road sit half-booked because dispatch can't keep the schedule tight.  CentralComs fixes this with AI agents that answer every call, route each job to the right technician, and keep the calendar full. They handle intake, dispatch, and customer updates end to end working inside ServiceTitan, Housecall Pro, and Jobber so no lead slips through and no truck runs empty.  Capture every call. Book every tech. Never miss a job.",
