    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/da4a14a3baf739d13d28c4b5fd536756215a6801.png",
    "oneLiner": "The first wearable that reads your emotions to enhance your EQ. ",
    "longDescription": "We've spent decades tracking everything. Sleep. Recovery. Steps. All proxies for how we feel. Performance is 90% mental. And yet no one has built the feedback loop for our emotions. We close that loop by designing a device that understands how you feel, tells you why, and what you can do about it. Emotional intelligence becomes trainable, so you can better connect and create with those around you.",
