    "oneLiner": "AI Native Sourcing Broker For Overseas Manufacturing",
    "longDescription": "Saudara AI is an AI sourcing broker connecting American brands with vetted overseas factories.  US brands import $3T in goods a year and lose billions to ghost suppliers, hidden fees, and blown deadlines. The factories that actually deliver sit behind decades-old relationships outsiders can't break into. We were born into them.  Every deal runs through a real human broker, supercharged by AI that handles sourcing, quoting, QC, logistics and vendor financing. 10x faster, at a fraction of the cost.  Sourcing is the largest broken market in global trade. We're the on-ramp.",
