    "oneLiner": "We get your product picked by coding agents.",
    "longDescription": "Coding agents like Claude Code, Codex and Cursor now decide which tools get installed in a codebase. Armature runs the real agents inside a panel of realistic repositories, measures whether they pick you, and works with your team on the docs, SDK and content changes that make them choose you. Every change is tested on real agent runs before it ships.  Once agents use your product, Armature shows you what users do with it through AI, with self-serve MCP analytics and evals that catch regressions before your users see them.",
